WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:01.617
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.565 --> 00:00:05.464
Maya's old stand is too heavy to carry up to the clouds!

3
00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:08.902
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08.902 --> 00:00:11.547
This is Episode 73.

5
00:00:11.547 --> 00:00:13.509
Meet the lift-cart.

6
00:00:13.509 --> 00:00:16.924
It slides under the whole stand, just as it is.

7
00:00:16.924 --> 00:00:19.779
Friends keep buying cups the whole time.

8
00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:21.952
Then the balloons puff up.

9
00:00:21.952 --> 00:00:27.701
The stand lifts off, counter, cups, pitcher, everything, in one piece.

10
00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:29.701
Up through the clouds.

11
00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:31.761
Not one drop spilled.

12
00:00:31.761 --> 00:00:34.977
On the cloud, it lands in its new spot.

13
00:00:34.977 --> 00:00:39.819
Same stand, same cups, same pitcher, now up in Cloud Town.

14
00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:42.974
Nothing to rebuild, nothing to repack.

15
00:00:42.974 --> 00:00:47.418
That is AWS Application Migration Service, MGN.

16
00:00:47.418 --> 00:00:51.727
It lifts a whole server to the cloud as it is, while it keeps running.

17
00:00:51.727 --> 00:00:53.925
Now you know the lift-cart!

18
00:00:53.925 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

